==English==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|enm}} {{term|testifien}}, from {{etyl|fro}} {{term|testifier}}, from {{etyl|la}} {{term|testificari||to bear witness}}, from {{term|testis||a witness}} + {{term|facere||to make}} (see [[-fy]]).

===Verb===
{{en-verb|testif|i|ed}}  (''intransitive'' or ''transitive'')

# to make a [[declaration]], or give [[evidence]], under [[oath]]
# to make a [[statement]] based on [[personal]] [[knowledge]] or [[faith]]

====Related terms====
* [[attest]]
* [[testimony]]
* [[testimonial]]

